<mxCell id="n_corenote" value="&lt;b&gt;One admission in S4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. gateway → leader: REQUEST (req_id)&lt;br&gt;2. leader decides placement on the applied table&lt;br&gt;3. leader → followers: RAFT_AE with ADMIT entry&lt;br&gt;4. majority stored it → committed → every replica applies it&lt;br&gt;5. leader → site: ALLOCATE · → registry: ROUTE_SET&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Every message&lt;/b&gt; carries a Lamport clock &lt;b&gt;lc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(blue dashed o1 → core-1 = ALLOCATE)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="n_core">
<mxGeometry x="690" y="16" width="370" height="160" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
