<mxCell id="n_l_ab" value="edge-A ↔ edge-B: 400 Mb/s · 3 ms" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#036897;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="845" y="862" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#00AA00&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; from S1/S2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#D6006E&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; added in S3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#7B2FBE&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; new in S4&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#D6006E&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;pink&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = data plane (traffic)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#3333FF&quot;&gt;blue dashed&lt;/font&gt; = control plane&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#7B2FBE&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;purple dashed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = Raft&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#036897&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;thick&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; = network link (bandwidth · one-way delay)&lt;br&gt;Every box with “container” = one Docker container" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="60" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_sp1" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Coordination: Raft (new in S4)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Orchestrator = 3 replicas: o1, o2 (core), o3 (cloud)&lt;br&gt;2. Leader elected by majority vote, numbered by term&lt;br&gt;3. ADMIT / RELEASE / RESIZE = entries in a replicated log&lt;br&gt;4. Entry committed once a majority has stored it&lt;br&gt;5. Same log, same order → identical tables on all replicas" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="185" width="420" height="150" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_sp2" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Event ordering: Lamport clocks&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Every message carries the sender's counter lc&lt;br&gt;2. Send: lc + 1 · receive: max(own, msg) + 1&lt;br&gt;3. Cause → effect ⇒ lc(cause) &amp;lt; lc(effect)&lt;br&gt;4. Merged logs sorted by (lc, node), not wall time" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="345" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_sp3" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Leader failover&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Leader crash → followers hear nothing for 300–600 ms&lt;br&gt;2. A follower becomes candidate, wins a majority vote&lt;br&gt;3. New leader commits NOOP, registers alias with term&lt;br&gt;4. Clients retry with the same req_id → no duplicates" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_sp4" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Experiments (Milestone 4)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Overhead + message complexity: N = 1, 3, 5, 7&lt;br&gt;2. Commit delay vs where replicas are placed&lt;br&gt;3. Leader crash: election time, unavailability&lt;br&gt;4. Consistency vs uncoordinated orchestrators; skewed clocks" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="615" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="n_sp5" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Message complexity (N replicas)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Commit one entry: 2(N−1) messages&lt;br&gt;2. Election: 2(N−1) messages per candidate&lt;br&gt;3. Idle: 2(N−1) heartbeat messages every 50 ms" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
<mxGeometry x="20" y="750" width="420" height="100" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
</root>
</mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>